WEBVTT

00:17:28.469 --> 00:17:30.588
koji se osećaju bolje u svom gradu

00:17:30.588 --> 00:17:33.820
samim tim što su tamo.

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:37.292
Javna mesta mogu promeniti
to kako živite u gradu,

00:17:37.292 --> 00:17:39.462
kako se u njemu osećate,

00:17:39.462 --> 00:17:42.750
koji grad ćete odabrati,

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:45.521
i javno mesto je jedno
od najbitnijih razloga

00:17:45.521 --> 00:17:48.642
zašto u gradu ostajete.

00:17:48.642 --> 00:17:51.107
Verujem da je uspešan grad

00:17:51.107 --> 00:17:53.728
kao odlična žurka.

00:17:53.728 --> 00:17:57.633
Ljudi ostaju jer se sjajno provode.

00:17:57.633 --> 00:17:59.576
Hvala.

00:17:59.576 --> 00:18:05.529
(Aplauz)